1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,480
 I remember learning a lesson, one of many, from my younger sister, Linda.

2
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:12,460
 She said that she'd read her scriptures and see remarkable blessings promised by the Lord.

3
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:19,580
 In her mind, though, she saw a big asterisk that seemed to say, "Those blessings applied

4
00:00:19,580 --> 00:00:23,460
 everyone except Linda."

5
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:27,700
 Over the years, Linda came to a different realization.

6
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:34,900
 understood, I'm not extraordinary enough to warrant an exception. The blessings are promised

7
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:43,700
 to me too. Linda is extraordinary, but still no exception. Neither are you, brothers and sisters.

8
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:48,820
 There is no asterisk excluding you from God's richest blessings.

9
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:57,220
 If you think there is, take out a big eraser and obliterate that asterisk. You can rely on God's

10
